<title>PORTUGAL: Mundial Confianca block sale within group.</title>
<headline>Mundial Confianca block sale within group.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The near 10 million shares traded in insurer Mundial Confianca on Friday reflected a shifting of holdings within the Banco Comercial Portugues group, a major shareholder, an official source said.</p>
<p>Confianca finance director Paulo Vasconcelos told Reuters that BCP had decided to concentrate its holding in the insurer -- amounting to nearly 20 percent -- in one part of the banking group.</p>
<p>Mundial Confianca's share price was virtually unchanged at 1,277 escudos.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
